  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "\u00a7e\u00a7lStats:\u00a7r\n+20% Size\n+20% Movement Speed while not weakened\n-25% Damage Taken from all sources\n \n\u00a7e\u00a7lFeatures:\u00a7r\n- You see 75% better in darkness than most creatures. Toggleable.\n- While \u00a7c\u00a7l[Wet]\u00a7r or in cramped spaces, your +20% movement-speed bonus is suppressed and your damage dealt is reduced by 20%. Each second spent Wet adds 1 second to the lingering Wet penalty, up to 2 minutes; cramped-space weakness ends once you have room again.\n- Wearing at least 15 Armor points applies Wither I.\n- You are a Carnivore.\n \n\u00a7e\u00a7lAdrenaline:\u00a7r Once every 6 minutes, lethal damage is prevented, you are restored to 8 health, Crowd Control is broken, you briefly become Unstoppable, and you gain an additional 20% damage resistance for 35 seconds.",
